<!-- Berlin to Świnoujście (Swinemünde) by bike, May 2025, 3 days. Drawn after the fact (BRouter fastbike via Schwedt/Oder,
     the Oder valley and onto Usedom over the Anklam bridge; no ferries). Only Schwedt is known as ridden. Thinned to 20 m. Not a recorded track. -->
